  "prefLabel": "Ins 4601.02 Applicability and Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 4601.02 Applicability and Scope. This chapter shall be applicable to every insurance company licensed to write direct business in this state, except for insurance companies writing only credit, home warranty, travel, or title insurance.\n\nSource. #10024, eff 11-14-11; ss by #13148, eff 12-28-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins4600.html"
